// Every sound of the game, made from numbers when the game starts (no audio file needed).
// wave: the tone (sine, square, saw, triangle); tone: 1 = all tone, 0 = all noise.
// frequency -> frequencyEnd: the pitch glides over the duration. attack / decay shape the volume,
// lowpass (0 bright .. 1 dark) muffles it. A mod can replace any sound with { "file": "sounds/x.wav" }.
